msgctxt "#32212"
msgid "Shows you are rewatching on Trakt match your rewatch progress in Kodi. Episodes watched since the rewatch started are marked watched, and the rest unwatched. Start a rewatch from a show's context menu or on Trakt."
msgstr "Mae rhaglenni rydych chi'n eu hail-wylio ar Trakt yn cyfateb i'ch cynnydd ail-wylio yn Kodi. Mae penodau a wyliwyd ers i'r ail-wylio ddechrau yn cael eu nodi fel rhai a wyliwyd, a'r gweddill fel rhai heb eu gwylio. Dechreuwch ail-wylio o ddewislen cyd-destun rhaglen neu ar Trakt."

msgctxt "#32213"
msgid "Movie sync"
msgstr "Cysoni ffilmiau"

msgctxt "#32214"
msgid "Episode sync"
msgstr "Cysoni penodau"

msgctxt "#32215"
