msgctxt "#32217"
msgid "Watching"
msgstr "Yn gwylio"

msgctxt "#32218"
msgid "The Trakt add-on is also enabled. Both add-ons scrobble and sync with Trakt, so everything is done twice."
msgstr "Mae'r ychwanegyn Trakt hefyd wedi'i alluogi. Mae'r ddau ychwanegyn yn sgroblo ac yn cysoni â Trakt, felly mae popeth yn cael ei wneud ddwywaith."

msgctxt "#32219"
msgid "Keep both"
msgstr "Cadw'r ddau"

msgctxt "#32220"
msgid "Start rewatch"
msgstr "Dechrau ail-wylio"

msgctxt "#32221"
msgid "Start a rewatch on Trakt? Your progress starts again, and every episode is marked unwatched in Kodi."
msgstr "Dechrau ail-wylio ar Trakt? Bydd eich cynnydd yn dechrau eto, a bydd pob pennod yn cael ei nodi fel heb ei gwylio yn Kodi."

msgctxt "#32222"
msgid "Rewatch started"
msgstr "Ail-wylio wedi dechrau"

msgctxt "#32223"
msgid "Couldn't start rewatch"
msgstr "Methu dechrau ail-wylio"

msgctxt "#32224"
msgid "Use the OG Trakt theme"
msgstr "Defnyddio thema OG Trakt"

msgctxt "#32225"
msgid "Shows Trakt's red logo, hearts and highlights, as on og.trakt.tv."
msgstr "Yn dangos logo coch Trakt, y calonnau a'r lliw amlygu, fel ar og.trakt.tv."

msgctxt "#32226"
msgid "%i couldn't be synced"
msgstr "Methu cysoni %i"

msgctxt "#32227"
msgid "Your Trakt account is locked. Contact Trakt support."
msgstr "Mae eich cyfrif Trakt wedi'i gloi. Cysylltwch â chymorth Trakt."

msgctxt "#32228"
msgid "Watchlist limit of %i reached"
msgstr "Wedi cyrraedd terfyn y rhestr wylio o %i"

msgctxt "#32229"
msgid "Choose what to sync"
msgstr "Dewis beth i'w gysoni"

msgctxt "#32230"
msgid "Open the sync setup shown after connecting to Trakt."
msgstr "Agor y gosodiad cysoni a ddangosir ar ôl cysylltu â Trakt."

msgctxt "#32231"
msgid "Sync when Kodi finishes a library scan or clean. Otherwise a sync runs only when you start it, such as from the context menu."
msgstr "Cysoni pan fydd Kodi yn gorffen sganio neu lanhau'r llyfrgell. Fel arall dim ond pan fyddwch chi'n ei ddechrau y bydd cysoni'n rhedeg, er enghraifft o'r ddewislen cyd-destun."

msgctxt "#32232"
msgid "Notify when a sync after a library scan or clean starts and finishes."
msgstr "Hysbysu pan fydd cysoni ar ôl sganio neu lanhau'r llyfrgell yn dechrau ac yn gorffen."

msgctxt "#32233"
msgid "Show no sync notifications while a video plays."
msgstr "Peidio â dangos hysbysiadau cysoni tra bo fideo'n chwarae."

msgctxt "#32234"
msgid "Match items without an IMDb, TMDB or TVDB id by title and year, when scrobbling and syncing. Never used to unwatch items or clear ratings."
msgstr "Paru eitemau heb ID IMDb, TMDB na TVDB yn ôl teitl a blwyddyn, wrth sgroblo a chysoni. Ni chaiff byth ei ddefnyddio i nodi eitemau fel heb eu gwylio nac i glirio graddau."

msgctxt "#32235"
msgid "Watched status"
msgstr "Statws gwylio"

msgctxt "#32236"
msgid "Trakt to Kodi: Kodi matches Trakt, play counts and dates included, and anything with no plays on Trakt is unwatched. Kodi to Trakt: items watched in Kodi with no play on Trakt are added to its history. Both ways: each side gets the plays it's missing, and nothing is unwatched outside a Trakt rewatch."
msgstr "Trakt i Kodi: mae Kodi yn cyfateb i Trakt, gan gynnwys nifer y troeon chwarae a'r dyddiadau, a nodir unrhyw beth heb ei chwarae ar Trakt fel heb ei wylio. Kodi i Trakt: ychwanegir eitemau a wyliwyd yn Kodi heb eu chwarae ar Trakt at ei hanes. Y ddwy ffordd: mae pob ochr yn cael y troeon chwarae sydd ar goll ganddi, ac ni nodir dim fel heb ei wylio y tu allan i ail-wylio ar Trakt."

msgctxt "#32237"
msgid "Off"
msgstr "I ffwrdd"

msgctxt "#32238"
msgid "Trakt to Kodi"
msgstr "Trakt i Kodi"

msgctxt "#32239"
msgid "Kodi to Trakt"
msgstr "Kodi i Trakt"

msgctxt "#32240"
msgid "Both ways"
msgstr "Y ddwy ffordd"

msgctxt "#32241"
msgid "Ratings"
msgstr "Graddau"

msgctxt "#32242"
msgid "Movies, shows and episodes"
msgstr "Ffilmiau, rhaglenni a phenodau"

msgctxt "#32243"
msgid "Trakt to Kodi: Kodi matches Trakt, and ratings Trakt doesn't have are cleared in Kodi. Kodi to Trakt: Kodi's ratings are added to Trakt, replacing different ones. Both ways: missing ratings are copied each way, and where they differ Trakt's is kept."
msgstr "Trakt i Kodi: mae Kodi yn cyfateb i Trakt, a chaiff graddau nad oes gan Trakt eu clirio yn Kodi. Kodi i Trakt: ychwanegir graddau Kodi at Trakt, gan ddisodli rhai gwahanol. Y ddwy ffordd: caiff graddau coll eu copïo i'r ddau gyfeiriad, a lle maen nhw'n wahanol cedwir gradd Trakt."

msgctxt "#32244"
msgid "Resume points from Trakt"
msgstr "Pwyntiau ailddechrau o Trakt"

msgctxt "#32245"
msgid "Kodi resumes where Trakt has the item paused, such as from another device. Playback in Kodi still sends its progress to Trakt when this is off."
msgstr "Mae Kodi yn ailddechrau lle mae'r eitem wedi'i hoedi ar Trakt, er enghraifft o ddyfais arall. Mae chwarae yn Kodi yn dal i anfon ei gynnydd i Trakt pan fydd hwn i ffwrdd."

msgctxt "#32246"
msgid "Add"
msgstr "Ychwanegu"

msgctxt "#32247"
msgid "Add and remove"
msgstr "Ychwanegu a thynnu"

msgctxt "#32248"
msgid "Add: Kodi's items are added to the Trakt collection. Add and remove: collected items Kodi doesn't have are removed from it too, including ones from other devices or apps."
msgstr "Ychwanegu: ychwanegir eitemau Kodi at gasgliad Trakt. Ychwanegu a thynnu: caiff eitemau yn y casgliad nad ydynt gan Kodi eu tynnu ohono hefyd, gan gynnwys rhai o ddyfeisiau neu apiau eraill."

msgctxt "#32249"
msgid "Relay always scrobbles when connected. Sync handles what it didn't scrobble: other devices, older history."
msgstr "Mae Relay bob amser yn sgroblo pan fydd wedi cysylltu. Mae cysoni'n trin yr hyn na wnaeth ei sgroblo: dyfeisiau eraill, hanes hŷn."

msgctxt "#32250"
msgid "On"
msgstr "Ymlaen"

msgctxt "#32251"
msgid "Watched status isn't synced."
msgstr "Nid yw statws gwylio'n cael ei gysoni."

msgctxt "#32252"
msgid "Kodi matches Trakt, play counts and dates included. Anything with no plays on Trakt is unwatched in Kodi."
msgstr "Mae Kodi yn cyfateb i Trakt, gan gynnwys nifer y troeon chwarae a'r dyddiadau. Nodir unrhyw beth heb ei chwarae ar Trakt fel heb ei wylio yn Kodi."

msgctxt "#32253"
msgid "Items watched in Kodi with no play on Trakt are added to its history. Kodi isn't changed."
msgstr "Ychwanegir eitemau a wyliwyd yn Kodi heb eu chwarae ar Trakt at ei hanes. Nid yw Kodi yn cael ei newid."

msgctxt "#32254"
msgid "Each side gets the plays it's missing, and nothing is unwatched outside a Trakt rewatch."
msgstr "Mae pob ochr yn cael y troeon chwarae sydd ar goll ganddi, ac ni nodir dim fel heb ei wylio y tu allan i ail-wylio ar Trakt."

msgctxt "#32255"
msgid "Ratings aren't synced."
msgstr "Nid yw graddau'n cael eu cysoni."

msgctxt "#32256"
msgid "Kodi's ratings match Trakt, and ratings Trakt doesn't have are cleared in Kodi."
msgstr "Mae graddau Kodi yn cyfateb i Trakt, a chaiff graddau nad oes gan Trakt eu clirio yn Kodi."

msgctxt "#32257"
msgid "Kodi's ratings are added to Trakt, replacing different ones. Kodi isn't changed."
msgstr "Ychwanegir graddau Kodi at Trakt, gan ddisodli rhai gwahanol. Nid yw Kodi yn cael ei newid."

msgctxt "#32258"
msgid "Missing ratings are copied each way. Where they differ, Trakt's rating is kept."
msgstr "Caiff graddau coll eu copïo i'r ddau gyfeiriad. Lle maen nhw'n wahanol, cedwir gradd Trakt."

msgctxt "#32259"
msgid "Kodi keeps its own resume points."
msgstr "Mae Kodi yn cadw ei bwyntiau ailddechrau ei hun."

msgctxt "#32260"
msgid "Kodi resumes where Trakt has the item paused, such as from another device."
msgstr "Mae Kodi yn ailddechrau lle mae'r eitem wedi'i hoedi ar Trakt, er enghraifft o ddyfais arall."

msgctxt "#32261"
msgid "A sync runs only when you start it, such as from the context menu."
msgstr "Dim ond pan fyddwch chi'n ei ddechrau y bydd cysoni'n rhedeg, er enghraifft o'r ddewislen cyd-destun."

msgctxt "#32262"
msgid "Sync when Kodi finishes a library scan or clean."
msgstr "Cysoni pan fydd Kodi yn gorffen sganio neu lanhau'r llyfrgell."

msgctxt "#32263"
msgid "Save and sync"
msgstr "Cadw a chysoni"

msgctxt "#32264"
msgid "Unwatch %i items in Kodi to match Trakt?"
msgstr "Nodi %i eitem fel heb eu gwylio yn Kodi i gyfateb i Trakt?"

msgctxt "#32265"
msgid "Clear %i ratings in Kodi to match Trakt?"
msgstr "Clirio %i gradd yn Kodi i gyfateb i Trakt?"
